  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Women&apos;s participation in STEM, Higher Education and combatting GBV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the representation of women in higher education and STEM in Southern Africa is very low, intention is to engage a group of experts in higher education and STEM to gather data, conduct analysis and identify key root causes through case studies and broad consultation. The causes and strategies on how to overcome GBV will also be addressed.</narrative>
